# The demo's deliberately noisy rule: it flags every TODO, which reviewers
# reject until demotion moves it to shadow (beat D). Its owner is the demo's
# rule owner, so one "not important here" from them proposes a narrower
# file_patterns (teach-the-bot).
id: demo-todo-comments
kind: exemplar
category: Maintainability
severity: suggestion
owner: "@{{.Owner}}"
status: active
review_by: 2027-10-01
file_patterns: ["**/*.go"]
description: |
  TODO and FIXME comments should not be merged; open an issue instead and
  link it, so the work is tracked.
preferred_approach: |
  Replace the comment with a link to a tracking issue, or do the work.
what_to_flag: |
  - Any comment containing TODO or FIXME in an added line.
fix_policy: none
